              <zone h='5511' id='2' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='3854'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>Credit Risk &amp; Loan Default Analysis  ·  Vintage Performance</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#d7dee8' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>
Which vintages are underperforming and when default risk emerges</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='14' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#1b365d' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='11023' id='3' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='10181'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Default risk emerges between loan ages 12 and 36 months.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;EVIDENCE</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Among large matured vintages, 2016 is weakest at 23.3% and 2010 is strongest at 14.0%.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;BUSINESS MEANING</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Newer vintages must be compared at the same loan age.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;RECOMMENDED ACTION</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Investigate 2016 after controlling for grade mix.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-color-left' value='#2f5d8a' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-style-left' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='border-width-left' value='4' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='6' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='12' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='36334' id='4' name='Vintage Curves' w='100000' x='0' y='22429'>
